      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00420",
        "explanation": "The family provided a concrete teach-back of the diabetes plan.",
        "quote": "家里人我也交代了一遍"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
        "explanation": "Closure safety is undermined by earlier unsafe severe-hypoglycemia handling advice.",
        "quote": "叫不醒／抽搐**先塞糖再叫**"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded diabetes plan was traceable and mostly executable, with caregiver receipt. It was not safe as a closure because of the serious hypoglycemia-response commission and because the atrial-fibrillation anticoagulation thread was never closed.",
